## What We Are Building

We integrated the newly announced Google Antigravity **`/teamwork-preview`** multi-agent collaboration framework into the NEXORA project. This establishes native workflow definitions and project-scoped skill blueprints for running autonomous multi-agent teams across five specialized patterns (*Iterative Coding*, *Distributed Coding*, *Self-Verification*, *Document Review*, and *Long Proof*), tuned to NEXORA's Angular 18, OnPush, Signals, and Steam DesignMD standards.

---

