## Decisions Made

- **Dual config sync (`AGENTS.md` & `CLAUDE.md`)** — reason: `AGENTS.md` is standard for Google Antigravity & Gemini agents, while `CLAUDE.md` is read by Claude Code CLI; keeping both in sync ensures consistency across tools.
- **Project-scoped skill over global override** — reason: Enforces NEXORA-specific constraints (OnPush, Signals, Steam tokens, multi-persona isolation) when multi-agent teams execute tasks in this workspace.

